  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178620000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You're speaking with Mike at VeloFit. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178629600000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Mike, I'm calling because I need to return a pair of cycling shoes I bought a while back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178635533333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178641866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF8871-04.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178647066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it, one moment... Okay, I see the order. It looks like these were delivered to you 79 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178648599999
    },
    {
      "text": "That sounds about right. Is that too late to send them back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178655399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. Our policy allows for returns up to 10 days after delivery, so that's no problem. I can go ahead and process that for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178659599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, that's great news! I was worried I'd missed the window.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178668733332
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope, you're all set. I've just sent a prepaid return label to the email address on file. You should see it in your inbox shortly.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178672866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect. So I just print that out and stick it on the box?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178681733331
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly. Just pack the shoes back in their original box, attach the label, and you can drop it off at any postal service location. Once we receive it, we'll issue the refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178685799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, that was easy. Thanks so much for your help, Mike.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35623,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178697599997
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 205,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769178701466663
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's everything. Thanks again!",
